  <page_number>205</page_number>
  <running_head>CANTICORVM.</running_head>
  <main_text>
    <l n="1">Haud potis sum flamulas:</l>
    <l n="2">Quale nos molliffimo</l>
    <l n="3">Eminus pilo pecus</l>
    <l n="4">Guiladinis pascier</l>
    <l n="5">Confpicamur faltibus,</l>
    <l n="6">Talis est tibi coma,</l>
    <l n="7">Moll cella, crispula.</l>
    <l n="8" para="true">6. At gemellos dentium-</l>
    <l n="9">Ordines eburneos,</l>
    <l n="10">Ordines iunctissimos-</l>
    <l n="11">Compararim candido-</l>
    <l n="12">Cum bidentum vellere,</l>
    <l n="13">Quæ nitentes vitreo-</l>
    <l n="14">E lauacro prodeunt,</l>
    <l n="15">Cum gemellis singulæ-</l>
    <l n="16">Hinc &amp; inde fœtibus:</l>
    <l n="17">Nulla vt isto de grege-</l>
    <l n="18">Possit orba confpici.</l>
    <l n="19" para="true">7. Quale punici rubent-</l>
    <l n="20">Mali hiantis granula:</l>
    <l n="21">Tale quiddam crispulæ-</l>
    <l n="22">Inter emicat comæ-</l>
    <l n="23">Tortiles cincinnulos.</l>
    <l n="24" para="true">8. Sexies regis decem-</l>
    <l n="25">Coniuges recenseo:</l>
    <l n="26">Octies regi decem-</l>
    <l n="27">Concubinæ sunt mihi:</l>
    <l n="28">Sunt puellæ plurimæ.</l>
    <l n="29" para="true">9. Vna sed columbula,</l>
    <l n="30">Labis expers vnica.</l>
    <l n="31">Nouit hanc vnam parens-</l>
    <l n="32">Vnicámque, cæteris-</l>
    <l n="33">Abdicatis, approbat.</l>
    <l n="34">Hanc, puellæ cæteræ,</l>
    <l n="35">Regiæque coniuges-</l>
    <l n="36">Regiæque pellices,</l>
    <l n="37">Ter beatam prædicant.</l>
    <l n="38">His vehentes laudibus.</l>
    <l n="39">10. Ista, quænam est (inquiunt)</l>
    <l n="40">quiunt)</l>
    <l n="41">Qualis auroræ nitor</l>
    <l n="42">Lucem inaurat proximam?</l>
    <l n="43">Qualis est argenteis</l>
    <l n="44">Luna bigis emicans?</l>
    <l n="45">Quále splendet aurei</l>
    <l n="46">Fulgidum sàlis iubar?</l>
    <l n="47">Tam reformidabilis,</l>
    <l n="48">Militum quàm copiæ,</l>
    <l n="49">Ordinatæ fulgidis</l>
    <l n="50">Quum coruscant ensibus?</l>
    <l n="51" type="heading" level="2" para="true">SPONSA.</l>
    <l n="52">11. Vere iam sese nouo</l>
    <l n="53">Proferente veneram,</l>
    <l n="54">Vt nuceti plantulas</l>
    <l n="55">Conspicarer floridi,</l>
    <l n="56">Prodeuntes humidis</l>
    <l n="57">Hinc &amp; inde vallibus:</l>
    <l n="58">Vitis ecquid turgidis</l>
    <l n="59">Germinans ocellulis,</l>
    <l n="60">Spem coloni, gemmeas</l>
    <l n="61">Funditaret lacrymas,</l>
    <l n="62">Et rubellos punica</l>
    <l n="63">Parturirent flosculos:</l>
    <l n="64">12. Quum repente, nescia</l>
    <l n="65">Visa sum tamen mihi</l>
    <l n="66">Subuehi celerrimis</l>
    <l n="67">In quadrigis, qualibus</l>
    <l n="68">Insidere principum</l>
    <l n="69">Cernimus ditissimos.</l>
    <l n="70" type="heading" level="2" para="true">SPONSVS.</l>
    <l n="71">13. Ah redi, redi,</l>
    <l n="72">Sulamithis, ah redi,</l>
    <l n="73">Téque speetandam dato.</l>
    <l n="74">Quáta verò &amp; qualis hæc</l>
  </main_text>
